{"id": 363, "html": "<p>PKシーズンシナリオ「九州制覇」の開幕に伴い、PKシーズンにおいて新武将が追加されます。これに合わせて、PKシーズンの登用パック（名将パック、シーズン名将パック、報酬パック、天下布武パックを含む）の内容が更新されます。新しいパック内容は当該ページからご確認ください。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/6c75fe3a-f560-447e-a746-0ab4355928f9.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/3b6937d3-eefd-4640-90a9-c9ba89a32590.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/d79dfe3c-0b80-4c32-aca6-4bf455ec1712.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/71d04eac-4bd6-45c9-8232-c05d8d83ca5f.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/ff67b676-cab1-49a8-8aee-a1dad2d26c88.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/e856dc1b-249f-4a62-8c1d-20c3667ba8d2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/b35e56bd-da7c-4f8c-818d-5b72654838eb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/be2dcd21-0df2-4e50-9ce6-451702374feb.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/7e6c3a6e-58cf-4c24-a813-f004f5f702f8.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/7a9f0177-5140-43e6-8afd-23c6e3116ea2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/6697f63a-894e-4022-afb6-42f8702fc568.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-os.qookkagames.com/galaxy/tcp/upload/12557125-9953-4414-b4e7-b6eeb5db0857.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></p>"}